# The dashboard is a single self-contained HTML file - every number is already inlined
# in it, so nothing else needs to reach the CDN.
#
# This is an allowlist, not a denylist, on purpose. _build/_merged holds the raw exports
# with lead names, phone numbers and owners; on Netlify those were publicly downloadable
# because the publish root was ".". Allowlisting means a new data file added later is
# excluded by default instead of silently shipping to a public URL.
*
!Organics_Dashboard.html
!vercel.json
